 $q$USD 10,000 a year, USD 40,000 in total, for up to 8 semesters.$q$),
('f3cd6b0e-2422-47ea-9844-d7215cf620f3', 'Iowa State Launchpad International Student Excellence Award', 'Partial', null, 'https://iastate.edu/admission-and-aid/admissions/international-admissions/international-student-excellence-award',
