 $q$USD 6,000 a year, USD 24,000 in total, for up to 8 semesters.$q$),
('c86f464d-4c7d-4d44-87b5-9ada1c612f63', 'K-State International Excellence Award', 'Partial', null, 'https://www.k-state.edu/sfa/scholarships-aid/scholarships/future-students/international-scholarships',
