('c86f464d-4c7d-4d44-87b5-9ada1c612f63', 'K-State International Achievement Award', 'Partial', null, 'https://www.k-state.edu/sfa/scholarships-aid/scholarships/future-students/international-scholarships',
 $q$Who is eligible: New first-year international students. Requirements: A high school GPA of 3.20 to 3.49. Renewable if you keep a 3.0 K-State GPA. Self-sponsored or family-sponsored students paying non-resident tuition get priority. How to apply: No application. Your admission application triggers an automatic review. Apply by the priority date for your entry term, which the page does not state.$q$,
